{"seq":29,"slug":"imbalanced-learning-resampling","title":"不平衡学习与重采样","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"不平衡学习与重采样\">不平衡学习与重采样</h1><p>信用卡欺诈里真正的盗刷可能只占千分之一，工业质检的次品率常低到 0.1%，罕见病的阳性样本在整张表里只有寥寥几行。把这样的数据丢给一个默认配置的分类器，它往往会给出一个 99% 准确率却毫无用处的模型——因为只要永远预测&quot;多数类&quot;，它就能把准确率刷得很高，却把我们真正关心的那一小撮样本全部漏掉。这就是类别不平衡问题：当各类别样本数量悬殊时，标准的&quot;最小化整体错误&quot;目标会系统性地偏向多数类，而少数类恰恰是业务价值所在。本 hub 要解决的，正是如何让模型重新&quot;看见&quot;少数类。</p>\n<p>整个知识体系按四条主线递进，从理解问题到落地收口。<strong>第一条线是基础</strong>：先想清楚不平衡为什么难——它的根子在经验风险最小化的目标错位，而非&quot;数据不够&quot;；再把它在实践中的各种失效模式编成目录；最后画出一张解法谱系图，作为后续所有章节的导航。<strong>第二条线是重采样</strong>，这是数据层的武器：在喂给模型之前改变训练集的类别分布——过采样复制或合成少数类、欠采样削减多数类、以 SMOTE 为代表的合成采样及其庞大的变体家族。<strong>第三条线是算法层</strong>：不动数据，改动学习器本身——代价敏感学习把&quot;漏掉一个少数类样本&quot;的代价写进损失函数、专为不平衡设计的集成方法、以及最廉价却最常被忽视的阈值移动。<strong>第四条线是实践</strong>：用对的指标（PR-AUC、F-beta、MCC 而非准确率）来度量、避开重采样最致命的数据泄漏陷阱、并在真实系统里判断何时该出手、何时该按兵不动。</p>\n<p>推荐的学习路径随读者背景而不同。<strong>初学者</strong>应严格按章节顺序走：先读&quot;基础&quot;建立心智模型，再进&quot;重采样&quot;动手，然后&quot;算法&quot;补齐另一条技术路线，最后用&quot;实践&quot;收口。<strong>有经验的工程师</strong>若只想快速选型，可以先读<a href=\"foundations/imbalance-spectrum\">处理谱系</a>拿到决策地图，再直接跳到<a href=\"practice/imbalance-metrics\">评估指标</a>和<a href=\"practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样陷阱</a>这两篇——它们是最容易踩坑、回报也最高的部分。<strong>正在排查线上模型&quot;准确率高却没用&quot;的人</strong>，可以直接从<a href=\"foundations/imbalance-failure-modes\">失效模式</a>入手对症。</p>\n<p>前置知识方面，本 hub 假设读者已掌握监督分类的基本概念（训练/测试划分、交叉验证、混淆矩阵）和基础的概率与机器学习术语；不要求懂深度学习。涉及编码、缩放等数据准备细节时会指向<a href=\"../feature-engineering/feature-basics/feature-engineering-overview\">特征工程</a>。</p>\n<p>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界要划清楚。**<a href=\"../anomaly-detection/foundations/what-is-anomaly-detection\">异常检测</a><strong>处理的是另一种极端：当少数类极度稀少、标签几乎不可得、甚至&quot;异常&quot;本身没有统一定义时，问题从&quot;有监督的不平衡分类&quot;滑向&quot;无监督/半监督的离群识别&quot;——本 hub 谈的是你有两类带标签数据、只是数量悬殊；异常检测谈的是你基本只有正常样本。</strong><a href=\"../ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/experiment-design-principles\">A/B 测试与统计</a><strong>关心的是如何严谨地度量两个版本的差异，与本 hub 在&quot;避免评估自欺&quot;上有方法论交集，但它不涉及如何训练不平衡模型。</strong><a href=\"../mlops-model-deployment/foundations/what-is-mlops\">模型部署 MLOps</a><strong>接手的是模型上线后的事：监控、漂移、再训练——本 hub 在<a href=\"practice/imbalance-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>里把接力棒交给它。</strong><a href=\"../feature-engineering/feature-basics/feature-engineering-overview\">特征工程</a>**负责造特征，本 hub 只在重采样与编码交互处与之相邻。守住这些边界，本 hub 才能保持纯净：它只讲&quot;类别数量悬殊时，如何把模型训好、评准、用对&quot;。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-imbalance-hard","title":"为何不平衡难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/foundations/why-imbalance-hard"},{"seq":2,"slug":"imbalance-failure-modes","title":"失效模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/foundations/imbalance-failure-modes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"imbalance-spectrum","title":"处理谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/foundations/imbalance-spectrum"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"resampling","title":"重采样","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"oversampling","title":"过采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/oversampling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"undersampling","title":"欠采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/undersampling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smote-variants","title":"SMOTE 及变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/resampling/smote-variants"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithm","title":"算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-sensitive","title":"代价敏感学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm/cost-sensitive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ensemble-imbalance","title":"集成方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm/ensemble-imbalance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"threshold-moving","title":"阈值移动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/algorithm/threshold-moving"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"imbalance-metrics","title":"评估指标 (PR-AUC/F)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/practice/imbalance-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resampling-pitfalls","title":"重采样陷阱 (泄漏)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/practice/resampling-pitfalls"},{"seq":3,"slug":"imbalance-in-practice","title":"落地与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/imbalanced-learning-resampling/practice/imbalance-in-practice"}]}]}